        <mxCell id="c228" value="&lt;i&gt;Row 2 and row 7 are blank, and the four counts sit above the list. The two outlined groups share no invoice, so together they list the 9 invoices that Tutorial 2.1 found, which are typed below as values with the first shipment date of each order: each test finds only part of them. Every flagged invoice is dated before its first shipment.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="808" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
